- Based on the 2026-07-01 administrative-dong/province boundary release from
  vuski/admdongkor (https://github.com/vuski/admdongkor), derived from
  Statistics Korea SGIS (https://sgis.kostat.go.kr), KOGL Type 1 (attribution).
  See https://www.kogl.or.kr/info/licenseType1.do.
- Modified boundary geometry released by vuski/admdongkor under Creative
  Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
  Data-license terms: https://github.com/vuski/admdongkor/blob/master/LICENSE-DATA.
- CVIC transcribed the 2026-07-01 16-province polygons from the
  DevMinGeonPark/mapcn-kr prepared data/sido.json dataset (MIT-licensed
  application code, upstream SGIS-derived boundary CC BY 4.0).
  Prepared data: https://github.com/DevMinGeonPark/mapcn-kr/blob/main/data/sido.json
  SHA-256 of GeoJSON used as source:
  fe5a298eab78f4e8d09d22e4f79ac9ddac05cd7a07927937d603be747cfec851.
  CVIC modified the geometry into simplified static SVG path strings,
  projected into an 800x759 coordinate space with 0.01px rounding.
- The outline is not provider-issued R-ONE CLS_ID crosswalk and contains no
  statistical transaction data or individual/property reference.
